{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13365","headline":"东峰亭各赋一物得栖烟鸟 · 李岑","name":"东峰亭各赋一物得栖烟鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从来养毛羽，昔日曾飞迁。\n变转对朝阳，差池栖夕烟。\n遇此枝叶覆，夙举冀冲天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}